# Used by `npm run build:native` for App Store / Play Store shells.
# Absolute API — Capacitor loads file:// or capacitor:// assets, so /api/v1 will not resolve.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://fashionrise.app/api/v1
VITE_REGISTRATION_UI_ENABLED=false
VITE_MAGIC_UI_ENABLED=true
VITE_FITTING_ROOM_UI_ENABLED=true
VITE_STUDIO_FRONT_BACK_ENABLED=true
VITE_STUDIO_DUAL_MAGIC_ENABLED=true
# Show My Models on Home + drawer in App Store / TestFlight builds.
VITE_MY_CROQUIS_UI_ENABLED=true
VITE_MY_CROQUIS_ADULTS_NOTICE_TEXT=FashionRise Create Model is for authorized account holders uploading a fully clothed adult fashion pose reference. Confirm any real-person photo shows only consenting adults — never children. Designing children's clothing is supported in Studio with age-appropriate templates and mannequins and does not require uploading a child's photograph. If an identifiable person appears, including a celebrity or public figure, you must have all permissions or other lawful authorization required for the intended AI modifications and use of their likeness. Do not upload nonconsensual intimate images, sexualized or humiliating manipulations of identifiable people, or sexualized depictions of minors.
VITE_MY_CROQUIS_AI_NOTICE_TEXT=Generate sends your photo to authorized AI service providers (including OpenAI image processing when enabled) to create a fashion model underlay. This can incur AI usage cost under configured spend limits. Results may differ from your photo and are not a precise body scan or garment fit measurement. You accept responsibility for having the rights and permissions required for your submission. FashionRise may reject content that violates its policies or applicable law.
VITE_MY_CROQUIS_STORAGE_NOTICE_TEXT=Your uploaded photo and generated model are stored privately for your FashionRise account so you can use them in Studio. FashionRise and its authorized AI service providers may process the image as described in the Privacy Policy. Uploading does not automatically make content public — publishing requires a separate agreement. You can erase private Create Model media later from Create Model / My Models. Do not upload photos of children or of anyone who did not agree.
VITE_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://fashionrise.app
VITE_SOCIAL_INSTAGRAM=fashionrise
VITE_SOCIAL_TIKTOK=fashionrise
VITE_NATIVE_SHELL=true
